OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who escaped mental health
OL,4,Aunit found dead by road, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 30-year-old student was found dead in
OL,7,FNovember 1994 after breaking out of a
OL,8,Fmental health unit near Bangor, an
OL,9,Finquest has heard.
OL,11,FAnthony Whittle had paranoid
OL,12,Fschizophrenia and was taken to hospital
OL,13,Fand admitted to the Hergest psychiatric
OL,14,Funit at Ysbyty Gwynedd.
OL,16,FSpeaking at the time, his family
OL,17,Fdescribed hearing a "crash and bang" as
OL,18,Fhe escaped through the window of an
OL,19,Finterview room and fled down a sloping
OL,20,Froof.
