OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who escaped mental health
OL,4,Aunit found dead by road, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fresh inquest into the events around
OL,7,Fhis death began on Tuesday, after the
OL,8,Fhigh court ruled the original hearing
OL,9,Fin 1995 was inadequate.
